    "title": "A Night in a Cozy Cabin During a Gentle Snowstorm | Sleep Story, Fireplace & Snow Sounds (4 Hours)",
    "hook": "Fall asleep to a calm bedtime story set in a warm log cabin while a gentle snowstorm falls outside. Soft narration, crackling fireplace and falling snow in 4K, followed by a long, quiet sleep soundscape.",
    "about": "Tonight you walk a quiet snowy path to a small log cabin, step into the warmth of the fire, and settle in for the night. The story is slow and gentle on purpose, to help a busy mind let go, ease overthinking and drift toward sleep.\n\nThe narration lasts about two hours. After it ends, the picture and soft winter sounds keep playing, so you can stay asleep without anything waking you.\n\nTips: keep the volume low, dim your screen, and let the story carry you. There is no need to follow every word.",
